title.en:
{
  translation: Just when you think the day is over, it's not over at all! We're pushing forward, let's go! 💨💥
}

title.ko:
{
  translation: 하루가 끝난 줄 알았는데 전혀 끝나지 않았어! 아직도 계속 나아간다, 가보자고! 💨💥
}

title.zh-TW:
{
  translation: 以為一天結束了，結果根本還沒結束！繼續往前衝吧，出發啦！💨💥
}

title.id:
{
  translation: Kira-kira hari sudah berakhir, ternyata belum sama sekali! Masih terus maju, ayo berangkat! 💨💥
}

title.pt:
{
  translation: Achei que o dia tinha acabado, mas ainda não acabou nada! Continuamos em frente, vamos nessa! 💨💥
}
